# Hub
PORT=8787
# Local media library (gitignored). Default: <promedia>/data/library
# LIBRARY_ROOT=/absolute/path/to/data/library
# Optional Bible drop-folder (default: $LIBRARY_ROOT/bibles/import)
# BIBLE_IMPORT_DIR=/absolute/path/to/bibles/import


# Web (Vite)
# REST: leave VITE_HUB_URL unset to use same-origin + proxy (`/api` → hub).
# WS: in DEV the browser connects directly to ws://<page-host>:8787 by default
# (avoids flaky Vite WS proxy on some Macs). Override if needed:
# VITE_HUB_WS_URL=ws://localhost:8787
# VITE_HUB_URL=http://localhost:8787

# Google Ad Manager (Control header banner via GPT)
# Leave unset → dashed placeholder «Espacio publicitario · Google Ad Manager».
# Set both to load googletag and defineSlot for the Control header.
# Slot sizes: 970×90 / 728×90 (desktop), 320×50 / 320×100 (mobile), + fluid.
# VITE_GAM_NETWORK_CODE=123456789
# VITE_GAM_AD_UNIT=promedia_control_header
